query
EXPLAIN SELECT id FROM sac_vec WHERE a = 10 OR c = 50
  ORDER BY emb <-> [0, 0]::FLOAT[2] LIMIT 3;
----
QUERY PLAN
╭─ IRESEARCH_SCAN ──────────────────╮
│ Index: sac_vec                    │
│ Lookup: search                    │
│ Row Filter: (a = 10) OR (c = 50)  │
│ Score: l2_distance(emb, FLOAT[2]) │
│ Top: 3                            │
│ Projections: id                   │
│ ~4 rows                           │
╰───────────────────────────────────╯


